<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Equity Inns started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Equity Inns started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of Equity Inns Inc with a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- said analysts James Sullivan and Robert Levy said acquisitions and a healthy lodging industry should fuel growth in funds from operations (FFO).</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target $15-1/2.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 FFO $1.37 a share, comapred to $1.22 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 FFO $1.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- Equity Inn stock closed at 14 Tuesday.</p>
</text>
